## Original Content
Le projet de complexe de loisirs incluant trois parcs à thème à Cergy-Pontoise (Val-d’Oise), annoncé par Emmanuel Macron lundi à l’occasion de la venue à Paris du prince héritier saoudien, est porté par cette entreprise publique, filiale du fonds souverain saoudien.

## Summary
Qiddiya Investment Company, a Saudi public enterprise and subsidiary of the sovereign fund, is behind a leisure complex project featuring three theme parks in Cergy-Pontoise, France. This project was announced by French President Emmanuel Macron during a visit by the Saudi Crown Prince to Paris.

## Key Points
- Qiddiya Investment Company is a Saudi public enterprise and part of the sovereign fund.
- The project includes three theme parks in Cergy-Pontoise, Val-d’Oise.
- The announcement was made by Emmanuel Macron on a Monday.
- The timing coincided with the Saudi Crown Prince's visit to Paris.


